incomplete (environment is missing or a placeholder value; principal is missing or a placeholder value; privilege_posture is missing or a placeholder value; instrument is missing or a placeholder value; justification is missing or a placeholder value); add an indented continuation line 'provenance: environment=<v>; principal=<v>; privilege_posture=<production-equivalent|broader|narrower>; instrument=<live-call|simulation|static-analysis> — <justification>' under the checkbox."],"finding":"Acceptance-criteria / definition-of-done quality issues.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f607dd457c67f9209","impact":0.4,"is_primary":null,"location":"","norm_id":"ned06ebc801a522e3","priority":0.4,"reason":null,"recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Split compound criteria, replace subjective terms with observable outcomes, and state how each is verified.","tier":"DET","validity":1.0,"verification":null},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Add a short probe/measurement explaining the 10:25 PST onset (e.g. confirm the blob:none filter was present on the 09:24 PST pass too, and rule out a repack/GC or runner-image change) before relying on the remote-budget fix as the complete cure.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5b","T5e","T7"],"criteria":["T2"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.95,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["'Unchecked: why it began at 10:25 PST and not earlier.'","Only one experiment cited: 4.44s fresh vs 0.02s cached on operator host","If onset was triggered by something other than the blobless filter (always present), the single experiment does not explain the time-correlation"],"finding":"The plan explicitly leaves 'why it began at 10:25 PST and not earlier' unchecked, yet the fix assumes the blobless-filter lazy-fetch is the complete cause; if the true trigger was a repo repack/GC that evicted the blob from the pack (making an otherwise-fast local read suddenly remote), the remote budget may mask rather than cure the regression.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fca6f2d8c53966e0d","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Root cause (one experiment so far) — 'Unchecked: why it began at 10:25 PST and not earlier.'","norm_id":"ne15552fca8e2fe48","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["The 09:24 run and earlier passed under the same blob:none filter, so the filter alone cannot explain why reads crossed 5s only starting 10:25","A future change that re-localizes the blob could make the symptom vanish without the plan's fix being the reason"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Cite the 09:24 run's checkout config and blob locality to confirm the filter was constant, and note whether any repo repack/GC or runner image change landed around 10:25 PST; if the filter was constant, document what else slowed the read.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.375,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] State the acceptable worst-case per-read latency under the new 30s budget and confirm it fits within the reconcile-bridge schedule window.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5b","T5e","T7"],"criteria":["T5b"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.95,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Change moves both payload reads from 5s to 30s","Plan does not quantify the worst-case added latency per reconcile pass nor confirm it is acceptable within the hourly schedule budget"],"finding":"Raising the blob-read budget from 5s to 30s means each lock-read that triggers a lazy promisor fetch now blocks up to 30s before any resolution; the plan does not state the per-read latency/worst-case impact on a reconcile pass that reads the lock on its hot path.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f6f449e4822d1f358","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach — '_read_blob_bytes uses _REMOTE_TIMEOUT_SECS for both cat-file blob calls'","norm_id":"nd3d8c2953e8cb227","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A genuinely slow/unreachable promisor remote now stalls each lock read for 30s instead of failing at 5s, delaying the pass"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.375,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_reveal